description:
Purpose of the tender
The specification sets out the arrangements for the management, operation and community use of the sports facilities situated at Cecil Jones Academy ("the Facilities"), Southend on Sea.

The parties acknowledge that the Facilities have been developed to support:
o	Community participation in sport and physical activity;
o	Health, wellbeing and social inclusion;
o	Access to high-quality sporting facilities for local residents, clubs and community organisations;
